<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n108945" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποπίμπλημι</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>fill,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">φωτὸς τὰς διαστάσεις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ael.
					<u>NA</u>
					1.23
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. τινὰ ἐλπίδος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Philostr.
					<u>Her.</u>
					19.4
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰς ψυχὰς ἡδονῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Lib.
					<u>Or.</u>
					11.17
				</span></i>
			:—
				Pass.
			, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πώγωνος ἤδη
			ὑποπιμπλάμενος</span> now <i>beginning to have</i> a beard,
				<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Prt.</u>
				309a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γαργαλισμοῦ ὑποπλησθῆναι</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					253e
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑποπίμπλαμαι τοὺς ὀφθαλμοὺς
				δακρύων</span>
			<i>have my</i> eyes <i>filling</i> with tears, <i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>DMar.</u>
				12.2
			</span></i>: later also c. dat., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑ. δάκρυσιν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>AP</u>
					5.274
				</span></i>
			 (Paul. Sil.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Pass.
			, of women, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τέκνων ὑποπλησθῆναι</span>
			<i>become mothers of many</i> children, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				6.138
			</span></i>: abs., <i>become pregnant,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Ael.
				<u>NA</u>
				12.21
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.49
			</span></i>.</div>
